# A whole skirmish, as a person might play it: the capture's hand (`just capture-rts-play`) and
# smoke.rts_api_play's. Coordinates are the view's; `aim` looks where the game's camera shows a
# unit or a point of the field now.
0    move 640 360
# A look round: the wheel out a notch, and a turn with the middle button.
20   wheel -1
40   move 700 400
42   press middle
44   move 760 400
50   move 820 400
56   release middle
60   move 640 360
# Swordsmen, but for the column beside the archers: a box, and Ctrl+1 keeps them.
80   aim unit 1 -18 18
81   press left
86   aim unit 9 18 -18
90   release left
96   key ctrl down
97   key 1 down
98   key 1 up
99   key ctrl up
# The archers: a box round their block, Ctrl+2.
120  aim unit 10 -18 18
121  press left
126  aim unit 17 70 -18
130  release left
136  key ctrl down
137  key 2 down
138  key 2 up
139  key ctrl up
# The catapults: a box, Ctrl+3, and a right click on the watchtower.
160  aim unit 20 -18 18
161  press left
166  aim unit 23 18 -18
170  release left
176  key ctrl down
177  key 3 down
178  key 3 up
179  key ctrl up
190  aim field 44 4
192  press right
194  release right
# The swordsmen called back, and sent with F to attack-move on red's line.
220  key 1 down
221  key 1 up
230  key f down
231  key f up
240  aim field 30 7
242  press left
244  release left
# The archers behind them, attack-moving with Ctrl and a right click.
270  key 2 down
271  key 2 up
280  aim field 25 8
282  key ctrl down
283  press right
285  release right
286  key ctrl up
# The camera follows: W pans toward the fight.
300  move 640 360
310  key w down
370  key w up
# The window dragged smaller, and back: the frame letterboxed into it, the pointer mapped back.
400  resize 1600 1000
# A pause to look, and the menu opened and resumed.
460  key p down
461  key p up
520  key p down
521  key p up
600  key escape down
601  key escape up
640  aim ui resume
642  press left
644  release left
# A click on the minimap brings the camera over the middle of the field.
700  move 1186 587
702  press left
704  release left
860  resize 1920 1080
# The whole army on the barracks.
900  key e down
901  key e up
910  aim field 42 16
912  press right
914  release right
# A jump on the minimap, and the army again later on whatever stands.
1200 key e down
1201 key e up
1210 aim field 42 16
1212 press right
1214 release right
1500 key e down
1501 key e up
1510 aim field 44 4
1512 press right
1514 release right
